        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/a91393e4ba52cd2cfe70050c51f0b98f.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/a91393e4ba52cd2cfe70050c51f0b98f.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/a91393e4ba52cd2cfe70050c51f0b98f.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: This game requires a gamepad controller and utilizes sustained button presses. If you feel that holding a button down for longer than 10-15 seconds at a time will be uncomfortable, you may want to try the demo before purchasing. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MONUMENTUM is a metroidvania-rage-puzzle-platformer-pinball-like where you control both the environment and the player character. Overcome platforming challenges, climb upwards, and activate new mechanisms of movement to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/87bd86a7f1d33ddf338ebad414d3d42a.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/87bd86a7f1d33ddf338ebad414d3d42a.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/87bd86a7f1d33ddf338ebad414d3d42a.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 mechanism abilities to discover and activate</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/faa2b24f905e801b6ec7ce5ed3782ed2.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/faa2b24f905e801b6ec7ce5ed3782ed2.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/faa2b24f905e801b6ec7ce5ed3782ed2.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate and utilize long dormant mechanisms to reach new heights. Enjoy an immersive, diegetic experience. Play without forced UI or tutorial interruptions. Experiment and forge your own path upwards! You can't die but you can and will fall. Try not to fall though. But you will, probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/7509adf43ff0590d12464f528e619d8e.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/7509adf43ff0590d12464f528e619d8e.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/7509adf43ff0590d12464f528e619d8e.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/b11fb0ffa8f63b56cf1bf64963cd7f85.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/b11fb0ffa8f63b56cf1bf64963cd7f85.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/b11fb0ffa8f63b56cf1bf64963cd7f85.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/a91393e4ba52cd2cfe70050c51f0b98f.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/a91393e4ba52cd2cfe70050c51f0b98f.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/a91393e4ba52cd2cfe70050c51f0b98f.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: This game requires a gamepad controller and utilizes sustained button presses. If you feel that holding a button down for longer than 10-15 seconds at a time will be uncomfortable, you may want to try the demo before purchasing. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MONUMENTUM is a metroidvania-rage-puzzle-platformer-pinball-like where you control both the environment and the player character. Overcome platforming challenges, climb upwards, and activate new mechanisms of movement to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/87bd86a7f1d33ddf338ebad414d3d42a.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/87bd86a7f1d33ddf338ebad414d3d42a.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/87bd86a7f1d33ddf338ebad414d3d42a.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 mechanism abilities to discover and activate</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/faa2b24f905e801b6ec7ce5ed3782ed2.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/faa2b24f905e801b6ec7ce5ed3782ed2.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/faa2b24f905e801b6ec7ce5ed3782ed2.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate and utilize long dormant mechanisms to reach new heights. Enjoy an immersive, diegetic experience. Play without forced UI or tutorial interruptions. Experiment and forge your own path upwards! You can't die but you can and will fall. Try not to fall though. But you will, probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/7509adf43ff0590d12464f528e619d8e.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/7509adf43ff0590d12464f528e619d8e.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/7509adf43ff0590d12464f528e619d8e.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/b11fb0ffa8f63b56cf1bf64963cd7f85.poster.avif?t=1763228414\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/b11fb0ffa8f63b56cf1bf64963cd7f85.webm?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931170/extras/b11fb0ffa8f63b56cf1bf64963cd7f85.mp4?t=1763228414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
